<title>FRANCE: Axa holds less than 10 pct of BNP votes.</title>
<headline>Axa holds less than 10 pct of BNP votes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Insurer Axa SA has dropped below 10 percent of the voting rights of Banque Nationale de Paris (BNP), the financial markets council said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Axa now holds 9.90 percent of the votes, it said in a statement.</p>
</text>
